  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the rustic elegance of the countryside with this charming Jeminise Farmhouse Quilt Set, perfect for adding warmth and traditional style to any bedroom. Featuring classic patterns and soft fabrics, this quilt set can be personalized with a name and is available in multiple sizes, making it an ideal gift for loved ones on special occasions.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Rustic Elegance:</strong> Features classic farmhouse patterns and soft, natural fabrics to create a cozy, timeless look for your bedroom.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> A perfect gift choice for Christmas, New Year, holidays, anniversaries, or birthdays for mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, son, daughter, and other beloved family members.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Personalize your quilt by adding a name, and select your preferred size, with optional pillowcases available.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102\"x91\") to fit various bed dimensions.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable; simply wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat. Microfiber dries quickly and becomes fluffier after washing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set typically includes one quilt, with the option to add two pillowcases.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Made from polycotton, providing a comfortable and durable bedding option.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Sets</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Dragonfly</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Farmhouse Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Patchwork Style Pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), King (102\"x91\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + 2 Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
